   },
   "quote": {
    "id": "q7",
    "text": "On February 5, Khomeini named Mehdi Bazargan as prime minister of a provisional government. Although Bazargan did not immediately announce a cabinet, the move reinforced the conditions of dual authority that increasingly came to characterize the closing days of the Pahlavi monarchy.",
    "lang": "en",
    "cite": {
     "source": "loc-iran-country-study-1987",
